iddle of Montana"},{"t":86.1,"txt":"that no one knows about so I was like my"},{"t":88.2,"txt":"chances of getting in are slim to none"},{"t":90,"txt":"the day I got the email I was getting"},{"t":91.4,"txt":"ready for class and I immediately"},{"t":93.3,"txt":"stopped getting ready so I could call my"},{"t":95,"txt":"professor and call my parents be like I"},{"t":96.7,"txt":"got in I'm going I was super excited the"},{"t":99.7,"txt":"addition of that student member category"},{"t":101.3,"txt":"just a few years ago our membership"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"committee had a very thoughtful uh"},{"t":106.2,"txt":"choice to make there of how we can"},{"t":107.7,"txt":"ensure that uh the the population that's"},{"t":110.8,"txt":"participating in this uh leadership"},{"t":112.7,"txt":"Symposium is as diverse as possible"},{"t":115.2,"txt":"ensuring that the younger generation has"},{"t":117.1,"txt":"a voice in The Experience I've Loved"},{"t":119.2,"txt":"just what I've learned from the"},{"t":120.2,"txt":"leadership perspective and then just"},{"t":122.6,"txt":"even getting to network with people all"},{"t":124.6,"txt":"over the country has been amazing coming"},{"t":126.8,"txt":"down here I've met so many people from"},{"t":128.8,"txt":"so many different places so many"},{"t":130.6,"txt":"different backgrounds and it's been very"},{"t":132.5,"txt":"cool to just make those connections make"},{"t":134.8,"txt":"those friends and be able to talk about"},{"t":137.1,"txt":"how to build a career how to build a"},{"t":139.7,"txt":"name for myself in this industry before"},{"t":143.2,"txt":"possibly starting my own business"},{"t":144.6,"txt":"someday and I've just had a lot of"},{"t":146.6,"txt":"advice given to me from people who've"},{"t":148.2,"txt":"been in industry for 20 plus years I was"},{"t":151.3,"txt":"expecting it to be a little bit more"},{"t":153,"txt":"nerve-wracking and uh I was expecting it"},{"t":155.9,"txt":"to be uh a little bit more I want to say"},{"t":159.7,"txt":"intimidating but it actually as soon as"},{"t":162.5,"txt":"we started everybody started getting"},{"t":164.4,"txt":"along everybody had different ideas and"},{"t":166.9,"txt":"it's pretty much like a giant Community"},{"t":168.8,"txt":"everybody makes you feel welcome it's"},{"t":171,"txt":"actually helps you open up especially if"},{"t":173.6,"txt":"if you have ideas and you sit in the"},{"t":175.2,"txt":"back of the room and it feels like a"},{"t":177,"txt":"community so you kind of open up and"},{"t":179.4,"txt":"share your ideas I don't think there is"},{"t":181.6,"txt":"one type of leader I don't think that"},{"t":183.8,"txt":"the word leadership should be associated"},{"t":185.9,"txt":"with just one type of person there's"},{"t":187.4,"txt":"definitely more female leadership more"},{"t":189.7,"txt":"diversity coming up and I think it's"},{"t":192.3,"txt":"amazing and it's really opening people's"},{"t":194.8,"txt":"eyes and I think overall the more"},{"t":196.4,"txt":"diversity we have the better this"},{"t":198.2,"txt":"organization is going to be we've had"},{"t":199.7,"txt":"more than 600 individuals go through the"},{"t":201.7,"txt":"leadership Symposium and it continues to"},{"t":203.6,"txt":"grow and evolve each year to ensure that"},{"t":205.6,"txt":"we're providing contemporary training"},{"t":207.7,"txt":"and response to the needs of our members"},{"t":210.6,"txt":"and continuing to ensure that we're"},{"t":212.4,"txt":"providing them with uh knowledge and"},{"t":214.5,"txt":"Leadership skills that'll help them lead"},{"t":216.2,"txt":"into the future"}],"words":[{"t":12.24,"w":"so"},{"t":12.4,"w":"the"},{"t":12.519,"w":"leadership"},{"t":12.96,"w":"Symposium"},{"t":13.96,"w":"uh"},{"t":14.08,"w":"is"},{"t":14.32,"w":"our"},{"t":14.679,"w":"opportunity"},{"t":15.32,"w":"to"},{"t":15.92,"w":"identify"},{"t":16.8,"w":"and"},{"t":17.039,"w":"develop"},{"t":17.64,"w":"leaders"},{"t":18.16,"w":"within"},{"t":18.4,"w":"the"},{"t":18.6,"w":"society"},{"t